    "tpa_score_new": "(1) Attendance (20%): expect to attend every class, to arrive on time, and to participate in all class activities.\n(2) Term paper report (40%): a research paper written assignment, turned in late without prior approval will not be accepted after the due date.\n(3) Term paper Presentation (40%): Term paper presentation scheduled to be presented  in class.",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<ul>\n\t<li>(1) Attendance (20%): expect to attend every class, to arrive on time, and to participate in all class activities.</li>\n\t<li>(2) Term paper report (40%): a research paper written assignment, turned in late without prior approval will not be accepted after the due date.</li>\n\t<li>(3) Term paper Presentation (40%): Term paper presentation scheduled to be presented in class.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "course_pol": "•期望修課學生能夠準時上課及參加考試。\n•期望修課學生能夠落實課前預習以及課後複習。\n•期望修課學生在課堂上能夠尊重授課老師以及其他修課同學。",
    "course_pol_en": "Attendance: You are expected to attend every class, arrive on time, and actively participate in all class activities.\nTerm Paper Report: You have the option to either summarize a couple of journal articles (paper review) or write based on your own research.\nTerm Paper Presentation: This entails an in-class oral presentation based on your term paper report.",
    "course_rem": "本課程以全英文進行授課。",
    "course_rem_en": "This class is conducted in English as the medium of instruction (EMI).",
    "ais_meno": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>實踐學術誠信是老師和學生的共同責任，作弊、抄襲、造假、代簽到、代寫等違反學術誠信的行為是不被允許的，修課同學應該了解並遵守學術誠信原則。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Honesty:</strong>&nbsp;Always produce your original work and never submit someone else&#39;s work as your own.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Plagiarism:</strong>&nbsp;Avoid plagiarism by properly citing and referencing sources in your assignments and research papers.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Cheating:</strong>&nbsp;Do not engage in any form of cheating during exams or assignments.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Respect:</strong>&nbsp;Respect the academic integrity of your peers, instructors, and your institution.</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Honesty:</strong> Always produce your original work and never submit someone else&#39;s work as your own.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Plagiarism:</strong> Avoid plagiarism by properly citing and referencing sources in your assignments and research papers.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Cheating:</strong> Do not engage in any form of cheating during exams or assignments.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Respect:</strong> Respect the academic integrity of your peers, instructors, and your institution.</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
